    "claude",
    "-p",
    "Bug report for this repository (click):\n\nCalling `HelpFormatter.write_usage(prog, args)` with empty `args` writes only a blank line. The\nsame shows end to end: a command with no parameters and `options_metavar=\"\"` (or\n`options_metavar=None`) renders its `--help` with an empty first line where `Usage: cli` should\nbe.\n\nFix it so that, with no args, the usage prefix and the program name are still written \u2014 as a\nsingle line with no trailing space, honouring `current_indent` and keeping a caller-supplied\n(possibly ANSI-styled) `prefix` verbatim. Behaviour with non-empty args must not change.\n\nChange as little as possible and do not edit the tests. The test command is\n`python -m pytest -q -o pythonpath=src tests/test_formatting.py`; run it once at the end.",
